		{
			"id": "A5im9up-BQTJ97F0W",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the reviewed package: ST 5, DX 8, IQ 6, HT 10, HP 5, WILL 6, PER 6, FP 10, SPEED 4.5, MOVE 4, DODGE 7, DR 2. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
